524
00:33:30.673 --> 00:33:31.908
What?

525
00:33:31.975 --> 00:33:33.276
I told you, come on.

526
00:33:33.343 --> 00:33:35.211
If we don't
inspire Denisovich,

527
00:33:35.278 --> 00:33:37.246
how's he going to
